But I personally don’t directly run a jewelry chain, but I do.

4
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:07,080
I can introduce you to a police buyer

5
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:11,640
They are all big players in the national jewelry industry. Your condition is that no commission is required.

6
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:13,400
Find a good, private and safe place

7
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:14,880
Hold a small private auction

8
