20
00:00:41,780 --> 00:00:42,860
As long as the goods are genuine

21
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:44,220
I am willing to pay the market price for blood

22
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:46,420
Buy lines at sky-high prices that are one to three times higher

23
00:00:46,980 --> 00:00:50,100
I've kept the things about the wild mountain people in mind and I'll help you keep an eye on them.
